---
import Container from "./Container.astro"
---

<div id="features" class="py-20">
  <Container>
    <div class="md:w-2/3 lg:w-1/2">
      <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 mb-6">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-bluedsc">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9 4.5a.75.75 0 01.721.544l.813 2.846a3.75 3.75 0 002.576 2.576l2.846.813a.75.75 0 010 1.442l-2.846.813a3.75 3.75 0 00-2.576 2.576l-.813 2.846a.75.75 0 01-1.442 0l-.813-2.846a3.75 3.75 0 00-2.576-2.576l-2.846-.813a.75.75 0 010-1.442l2.846-.813A3.75 3.75 0 007.466 7.89l.813-2.846A.75.75 0 019 4.5zM18 1.5a.75.75 0 01.728.568l.258 1.036c.236.94.97 1.674 1.91 1.91l1.036.258a.75.75 0 010 1.456l-1.036.258c-.94.236-1.674.97-1.91 1.91l-.258 1.036a.75.75 0 01-1.456 0l-.258-1.036a2.625 2.625 0 00-1.91-1.91l-1.036-.258a.75.75 0 010-1.456l1.036-.258a2.625 2.625 0 001.91-1.91l.258-1.036A.75.75 0 0118 1.5zM16.5 15a.75.75 0 01.712.513l.394 1.183c.15.447.5.799.948.948l1.183.395a.75.75 0 010 1.422l-1.183.395c-.447.15-.799.5-.948.948l-.395 1.183a.75.75 0 01-1.422 0l-.395-1.183a1.5 1.5 0 00-.948-.948l-1.183-.395a.75.75 0 010-1.422l1.183-.395c.447-.15.799-.5.948-.948l.395-1.183A.75.75 0 0116.5 15z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white md:text-4xl leading-tight">
        Seguridad física y digital <br/> <span class="text-bluedsc dark:text-blue-400">unificadas en un solo lugar.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Impulsamos el crecimiento sostenido de su negocio a través de seguridad inteligente, acompañamiento experto y mejora continua.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-200 dark:hover:border-blue-900 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5">
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors group-hover:bg-bluedsc">
            <img src="../../images/bloqueado.png" class="w-6 transition-all group-hover:invert group-hover:brightness-0" alt="Seguridad" />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Seguridad</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Blindamos sus activos digitales y físicos. Aplicamos las mejores prácticas para prevenir vulnerabilidades.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-200 dark:hover:border-blue-900 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5">
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors group-hover:bg-bluedsc">
            <img src="../../images/seguimiento.png" class="w-6 transition-all group-hover:invert group-hover:brightness-0" alt="Seguimiento" />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Compromiso</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Su visión es nuestra prioridad. Mantenemos una comunicación constante para evolucionar con sus metas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-200 dark:hover:border-blue-900 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5">
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors group-hover:bg-bluedsc">
            <img src="../../images/soporte.png" class="w-6 transition-all group-hover:invert group-hover:brightness-0" alt="Soporte" />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Capacitación</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Asesoría técnica personalizada para que su equipo domine cada aspecto de sus nuevos sistemas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-200 dark:hover:border-blue-900 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5">
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors group-hover:bg-bluedsc">
            <img src="../../images/mantenimiento.png" class="w-6 transition-all group-hover:invert group-hover:brightness-0" alt="Mantenimiento" />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Continuidad</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Garantizamos que su infraestructura se mantenga operativa, actualizada y adaptada a su industria.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </Container>
</div>